---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Medical Disclaimer"
  description="Important information about how to use the content on Cairns Skin."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-5 md:px-8 py-14 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="mb-6">Medical Disclaimer</h1>

    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      The content on Cairns Skin is provided for general educational purposes
      only. It is not intended as, and should not be relied upon as, individual
      medical advice.
    </p>

    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Every person's skin is different. Information about skin concerns and
      treatments on this website describes general patterns and common
      clinical experience, and it cannot account for your specific medical
      history, skin type, medications or circumstances. Outcomes from any
      treatment vary between individuals, and no outcome can be guaranteed.
    </p>

    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Before starting any treatment, seek the advice of a qualified health
      professional or clinician who can assess your individual suitability.
      If you have a concern that may indicate a medical condition, see a
      doctor rather than relying on this website.
    </p>

    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Articles on this site are reviewed before publication, but medical and
      clinical understanding evolves. We aim to keep content current and note
      a last-reviewed date on every article, but we cannot guarantee that
      every detail reflects the latest available evidence at the moment you
      read it.
    </p>

    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
      This website is connected to Laser Clinics Cairns, but not every
      treatment referenced is necessarily available at every Laser Clinics
      location. Confirm current availability directly with the clinic.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
